@Haroenv no I didn't!
That does work!

```js
var search = instantsearch({
      ...
      searchParameters: {
            enableRules: false
      }
});
```

👍
Now being able to do this without code change, through an `enableRules` query parameter, would be nice.
But I could implement my own solution to enable/disable this setting though. Since it is part of the `searchParameter`, it makes it easy to do.
